{
    "word": "boggy",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "2d347c2e-be7b-33b1-b14e-60c2450baf06",
                "word": "boggy",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2df7ebac-f213-40dc-95da-e353cc732b71",
                        "entry_id": "2d347c2e-be7b-33b1-b14e-60c2450baf06",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "boggier"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a76edfc3-4aee-4bd7-8ebe-53a2baba9a12",
                        "entry_id": "2d347c2e-be7b-33b1-b14e-60c2450baf06",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "boggiest"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e38a8a9b-2975-3066-b841-33fff1fb6f5f",
                        "entry_id": "2d347c2e-be7b-33b1-b14e-60c2450baf06",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having the qualities of a bog; i.e. dank, squishy, muddy, and full of water and rotting vegetation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a185fa97-0dd9-4fc6-a9f8-f813245d6bf7",
                                "sense_id": "e38a8a9b-2975-3066-b841-33fff1fb6f5f",
                                "text": "The edge of the woods led out onto a noisome, boggy fen, a paradise for mosquitos and small frogs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb72ac9b-1032-4afb-b8e9-6cf33e1254b3",
                                "sense_id": "e38a8a9b-2975-3066-b841-33fff1fb6f5f",
                                "text": "Offer a bulky and boggy bun to the suspected individual just ten minutes before dinner. If this is eagerly accepted and devoured, the fact of youth is established."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f226ef85-269e-48d0-86f9-c13c4592fbee",
                                "sense_id": "e38a8a9b-2975-3066-b841-33fff1fb6f5f",
                                "text": "But the might-have-been is but boggy ground to build on."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1d05308-0e80-4332-bf39-48677333b1a9",
                                "sense_id": "e38a8a9b-2975-3066-b841-33fff1fb6f5f",
                                "text": "As well as being a magnet for wildlife, Flow Country is also special for its valuable role in mitigating climate change, as the boggy ground provides a huge natural sink for carbon dioxide."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8f4393d1-d3cb-42da-850d-963462ce7770",
                        "source_entry_id": "2d347c2e-be7b-33b1-b14e-60c2450baf06",
                        "source_sense_id": "e38a8a9b-2975-3066-b841-33fff1fb6f5f",
                        "source_sense_description": "having the qualities of a bog",
                        "target_lang_word": "marécageux",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "marécageux",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "965ca15d-f168-3db4-99be-71335903e52c",
                                        "entry_id": "619391dd-6268-370c-b243-0c5af34b19f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est de la nature du marécage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03af1546-3568-47cf-9855-ddf4233ea0c9",
                                                "sense_id": "965ca15d-f168-3db4-99be-71335903e52c",
                                                "text": "Les Aroïdées habitent généralement les lieux humides, marécageux, et les bois très-ombragés; elles sont presque toutes âcres, même vésicantes. On distingue dans cette famille le Gouet ou Pied-de-veau (Arum L.), le Calla et l’Acorus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd18c9fb-40d9-476c-9fba-29330dd45b3e",
                                                "sense_id": "965ca15d-f168-3db4-99be-71335903e52c",
                                                "text": "À l’ouest, la plaine, s’abaissant encore, devenait marécageuse, et s’imbibait d’une eau stagnante qui alimentait les affluents du Kuruman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13c8dab2-4a4f-460e-8421-d4147476eb41",
                                                "sense_id": "965ca15d-f168-3db4-99be-71335903e52c",
                                                "text": "Le sol y est compact, souvent imperméable, marécageux par endroits, d’où le caractère mésohygrophile de la flore […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5fafa0dc-899f-3190-9553-fb9d8811b029",
                                        "entry_id": "619391dd-6268-370c-b243-0c5af34b19f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est morbide, malsain ou étouffant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87108cc5-d814-490f-88f9-5bbc5cc421d0",
                                                "sense_id": "5fafa0dc-899f-3190-9553-fb9d8811b029",
                                                "text": "Le garçon marchand de vins du coin lance un œil marécageux au trottin de la modiste d’en face, — petite fille à tout faire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
